<title>USA: Phar-Mor, Shopko in $1 bln merger.</title>
<headline>Phar-Mor, Shopko in $1 bln merger.</headline>
<dateline>YOUNGSTOWN, Ohio 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Phar-Mor Inc and ShopKo Inc said Monday they have signed an agreement to combine their two companies under a new holding company, in a deal valued at $1 billion, including the assumption of debt. The new company will be called Cabot Noble Inc and is expected to have combined annual sales of about $3.2 billion and 232 stores in 29 states, the companies said.</p>
</text>
